{%- comment -%}
  MUTO — buy box copy (muto-bf-buybox-copy). Two pieces of plain-English copy in the main product page's buy box:
  1. Under the headline ("Flat by 3pm? Slower to bounce back?", the buy section's Heading setting): one plain line,
     the product's name, what it is and who it's for, in place of "Built for life after 35." (drawn by the theme's
     CSS, hidden). The "Five supplements in one daily jar…" line under the guarantee badge is hidden too, so the
     product is described once. The guarantee badge reads "Give it 90 days. Test it, or get your money back."
  The "Black Friday: 3 months for £99 · While stock lasts" line under the reviews box is hidden, and the three bold
  ticks above the reviews box are one small grey line.
  2. "Skip, pause or cancel online · cancel in 2 clicks", directly under the plan cards (above Add to cart).
     The same line was taken out of the "Delivery, subscription and guarantee" dropdown.
  Rendered by the custom-liquid section after the buy box (ag1_plans); a small script puts each piece in place.
  Wording follows the jobs-to-be-done research (Nov 2026): say what it is and who it's for first, in plain words.
{%- endcomment -%}
<p class="mc-sub" data-mc-sub hidden><b>NAD<sup>+</sup> Cellular Complex</b> is two capsules a day for energy, recovery and ageing well. One jar instead of a shelf of pots, made for over-35s whose lives don’t fit a perfect routine.</p>
<p class="mc-skip" data-mc-skip hidden>Skip, pause or cancel online <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> cancel in 2 clicks</p>
<style>
  /* The theme's "Five supplements in one daily jar…" line under the guarantee badge: hidden (the line under the headline says it) */
  html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc__buy-copy > .mc__eyebrow::after{content:none!important;display:none!important}
  html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc__buy-title::after{content:none!important;display:none!important}
  /* The "Black Friday: 3 months for £99 · While stock lasts" line under the reviews box: removed on request */
  html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc-subhead::after{content:none!important;display:none!important}
  /* The three bold ticks (No proprietary blends / Third-party tested / Made in the UK): one quiet grey line instead */
  html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc-subhead::before{content:"No proprietary blends  ·  Third-party tested  ·  Made in the UK"!important;display:block!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;padding:0!important;background:none!important;font-family:var(--mc-font)!important;font-size:14px!important;font-weight:400!important;line-height:1.4!important;letter-spacing:0!important;text-transform:none!important;color:rgba(36,34,35,.6)!important}
  @media (max-width:749px){html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc-subhead::before{font-size:13px!important}}
  html:root body #MainContent#MainContent .mc .mc__buy-copy > .mc__eyebrow::before{content:"Give it 90 days. Test it, or get your money back."!important;white-space:normal!important;max-width:100%;line-height:1.35!important;padding-top:8px!important;padding-bottom:8px!important}
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-sub{order:-4;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0;font-family:var(--mc-font);font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(36,34,35,.72);text-wrap:pretty;text-align:left}
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-sub b{font-weight:500;color:#242223}
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-sub sup{font-size:.6em;line-height:0}
  /* The quiet proof line sits just under the guarantee badge */
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-subhead{margin-top:14px!important}
  .mc-sub[hidden]{display:none!important}
  .mc-skip[hidden]{display:none!important}
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-skip{order:2;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0;font-family:var(--mc-font);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;color:#242223}
  html body #MainContent .mc .mc-skip span{margin:0 4px;opacity:.5}
  @media (max-width:749px){
          html body #MainContent .mc .mc-skip{font-size:13.5px}
    html body #MainContent .mc .mc-sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:10px}
  }
</style>
<script>
(function () {
  function init() {
    var buy = document.querySelector('#MainContent [id$="__buy"]');
    if (!buy) return;
    var sub = document.querySelector('[data-mc-sub]'), h1 = buy.querySelector('.mc__buy-title');
    if (sub && h1 && !sub.getAttribute('data-ready')) {
      h1.parentNode.insertBefore(sub, h1.nextSibling);
      sub.setAttribute('data-ready', '1'); sub.hidden = false;
    }
    var skip = document.querySelector('[data-mc-skip]'), plans = buy.querySelector('.mc__plans');
    if (skip && plans && !skip.getAttribute('data-ready')) {
      plans.parentNode.insertBefore(skip, plans.nextSibling);
      skip.setAttribute('data-ready', '1'); skip.hidden = false;
    }
  }
  init();
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init); else setTimeout(init, 0);
})();
</script>
